{"id": "85924", "name": "חלוקה ביחס 5:7 – החלק של A (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>If £ {{CT:0}} is divided between two people \\(A\\) and \\(B\\) in the ratio \\(5:7\\), then \\(A\\) gets how much? £ [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>We first work out the total number of parts that are to be shared out. We know the ratio is \\(5:7\\), so the total number of parts is \\(5+7=12\\).</p>\n <p>So we divide {{CT:0}} by 12 to get {{CT:1}}, which is the value of each part.</p>\n <p>To work out how much \\(A\\) gets we multiply {{CT:1}} by \\(5\\).</p>\n <p>So \\(A\\) gets £ {{CT:2}}.</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "n", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-RTP-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "NUM-RTP-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "m", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "WRONG_SHARE", "feedback": "<p>It seems you have worked out B's share instead.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-RTP-1-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["m", "n", "p", "r"], "nvariants": 7}